## 🔀 阶段3：多模态特征融合

### 3.1 数据集类型检测

**文件位置**: `modeling/make_model.py::MambaPro.forward()`

```python
# 检测是否为双模态数据集
is_dual_modal = torch.allclose(NI_global, TI_global, atol=1e-6)

if is_dual_modal:
    # RGBNT100: 双模态（RGB + IR）
    ori = torch.cat([RGB_global, NI_global], dim=-1)  # [B, 1024]
else:
    # RGBNT201: 三模态（RGB + NIR + TIR）
    ori = torch.cat([RGB_global, NI_global, TI_global], dim=-1)  # [B, 1536]
```

### 3.2 特征融合策略

#### 策略A: 简单拼接（MAMBA=False）

```python
# 拼接特征
ori = torch.cat([RGB_global, NI_global, TI_global], dim=-1)  # [B, 1536]

# BNNeck降维
ori_global = self.bottleneck(ori)  # [B, feat_dim]

# 分类
ori_score = self.classifier(ori_global)  # [B, num_classes]
```

#### 策略B: Mamba聚合融合（MAMBA=True）

**文件位置**: `modeling/fusion_part/AAM.py::AAM.forward()`

```python
def forward(self, r, n, t):
    # 输入: RGB_tokens [B, 129, 512], NI_tokens [B, 129, 512], TI_tokens [B, 129, 512]
    
    # 分离CLS token和patch tokens
    cls_r = r[:, 0]      # [B, 512]
    cls_n = n[:, 0]     # [B, 512]
    cls_t = t[:, 0]     # [B, 512]
    r = r[:, 1:]        # [B, 128, 512]
    n = n[:, 1:]        # [B, 128, 512]
    t = t[:, 1:]        # [B, 128, 512]
    
    # Mamba聚合块处理
    for i in range(len(self.ma_block)):
        r, n, t = self.ma_block[i](r, n, t)
    
    # 特征提取
    patch_r = torch.mean(r, dim=1)  # [B, 512]
    patch_n = torch.mean(n, dim=1)  # [B, 512]
    patch_t = torch.mean(t, dim=1)  # [B, 512]
    
    # 线性降维
    r_feature = self.linear_reduction_r(torch.cat([cls_r, patch_r], dim=-1))  # [B, 512]
    n_feature = self.linear_reduction_n(torch.cat([cls_n, patch_n], dim=-1))  # [B, 512]
    t_feature = self.linear_reduction_t(torch.cat([cls_t, patch_t], dim=-1))  # [B, 512]
    
    # 拼接
    fuse = torch.cat([r_feature, n_feature, t_feature], dim=-1)  # [B, 1536]
    
    return fuse
```

**后续处理**:
```python
# BNNeck降维
fuse_global = self.bottleneck_fuse(fuse)  # [B, feat_dim]

# 分类
fuse_score = self.classifier_fuse(fuse_global)  # [B, num_classes]
```

